WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.443
The CIS Controls are a collection of cybersecurity safeguards and recommended practices

00:00:04.443 --> 00:00:06.252
designed to improve security posture.

00:00:06.252 --> 00:00:10.595
They focus on practical defensive measures that organizations can implement to address

00:00:10.595 --> 00:00:12.405
common threats and operational risks.

00:00:12.405 --> 00:00:16.386
The controls are widely used because they are actionable and understandable.

00:00:16.386 --> 00:00:20.729
They help teams move from broad security concern to specific improvement activities.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:25.071
The CIS Controls are not a software product or a single tool.

00:00:25.071 --> 00:00:29.414
They are a set of practices that can guide planning, operations, governance,

00:00:29.414 --> 00:00:30.500
and continuous improvement.
